          %div
            %h3#ReferencesUnstableClassificationOfTopologicalPhases Unstable classification of topological phases
            %p
              Arguments that some effects in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+phases+of+matter"} topological phases of matter
              are “unstable” or “fragile” in that the relevant deformation class of their
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/valence+bundles"} valence bundles
              over the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brillouin+torus"} Brillouin torus
              is not their class in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
              (as assumed by the
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K-theory+classification+of+topological+phases+of+matter"} K-theory classification of topological phases of matter
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+class"} homotopy class
              (what may be called a class in generalized
              = succeed ")" do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonabelian+cohomology"} nonabelian cohomology
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grassmannian+space"} Grassmannian space
              (or more general
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flag+variety"} flag variety
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sub-bundles"} sub-bundles
              of a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/trivial+bundle"} trivial
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+bundle"} vector bundle
              of fixed
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+number"} finite
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rank+of+a+vector+bundle"} rank
            %p Influential precursor discussion:
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+P.+Schnyder"}> Andreas P. Schnyder
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shinsei+Ryu"} Shinsei Ryu
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Akira+Furusaki"} Akira Furusaki
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+W.+W.+Ludwig"} Andreas W. W. Ludwig
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classification of topological insulators and superconductors in three spatial dimensions
                %strong 78
                195125 (2008) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.78.195125"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.78.195125
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0803.2786"} arXiv:0803.2786
            %p More explicit highlighting:
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Adrien+Bouhon"}> Adrien Bouhon
                ,
                = succeed "," do
